{"availability":"available","full":"npmaiecosystem/NPM-AutoCode-AI","name":"NPM-AutoCode-AI","description":"NPM AutoCode AI is a Python desktop app that generates, validates, and executes Python code using AI. Simply describe a task in plain English, and it uses NPMAI to create and safely run the required script. Built for non-technical users, it turns ideas into working code with no manual coding required.","category":"Productivity","language":"Python","stars":3,"forks":2,"created":"2025-12-18T12:36:15Z","updated":"2026-10-10T06:17:50Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://npmcodeai.netlify.app","topics":["ai-agents","ai-tools","auto-code-generator","automation","full-autonomous-agents","no-pre-defined-tools","npm-autocode-ai","npmai","pc-automation"],"demo":"https://npmcodeai.netlify.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:50.276Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:50.276Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:50.276Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T11:07:50.276Z","stars":3,"forks":2}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Windows .exe · macOS .app · Linux binary — all built straight from this repo, every release.","NPM-AutoCode-AI is a desktop app: you type a task in plain English — \"scrape this page and email me a summary\", \"resize every image in this folder\", \"push this fix to GitHub\" — and it plans, writes, safety-audits, and runs the Python for you. Live, in front of you, on your own machine.","Under the hood, it's powered by [npmai-agents]( — the actual open-source reasoning engine (published on PyPI) that gives the app its 1,371 tools, its safety auditing, and its multi-role planning pipeline. NPM-AutoCode-AI is the face; npmai-agents is the brain."],"features":["🗣 Natural language → working Python — describe the task, watch it get built.","🛡 Safety-audited before execution — the Auditor role flags risky code (file deletion, remote access) before","🔁 Auto-debug loop — errors get fed back to the Coder role and retried, not just dumped on you.","📈 Live logs + progress bar — full visibility while the agent works, nothing happens silently.","🔑 Bring-your-own-key, never forced — every LLM provider and every tool credential is opt-in and locally"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/npmaiecosystem/NPM-AutoCode-AI/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"6368acf359994b9449597620bb112d3965184f51f7a81d696bb9dd6c7473b4c7","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:50.373Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:50.373Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Windows .exe · macOS .app · Linux binary — all built straight from this repo, every release.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/npmaiecosystem/NPM-AutoCode-AI/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"optional","text":"Only if you want a stronger brain (GPT, Claude, Gemini...) do you ever touch an API key — and even then, it's","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/npmaiecosystem/NPM-AutoCode-AI/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"① Provider Credentials — add only the fields that provider actually needs (most: just an API key).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/npmaiecosystem/NPM-AutoCode-AI/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"6368acf359994b9449597620bb112d3965184f51f7a81d696bb9dd6c7473b4c7","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/npmaiecosystem/NPM-AutoCode-AI/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:50.373Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-10T06:17:50Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/npmaiecosystem/NPM-AutoCode-AI/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:50.374Z","hash":"6368acf359994b9449597620bb112d3965184f51f7a81d696bb9dd6c7473b4c7","originalBytes":14024,"storedBytes":14024,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["app","mcp","local","tool","every","job","llm","github","tools","credential","npmai-agents","per","runs","any","brain","desktop","key","locally","manager","m